    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d634">

                <pb facs="0604" n="432" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg432"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/4047</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-27T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department was unable to comply with request in your cipher telegram of April
                    25, 1 p.m. The bill was signed on April 24. The interpretation is a matter of
                    conjecture and must be decided by the Department of Justice.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
